<td>Parse PDFs, scans, formulas into structured text</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Re-ranking</td>
<td><strong>bge-reranker</strong>, <strong>Cohere rerank API</strong></td>
<td><code>[EXISTS]</code></td>
<td>Cross-encoder for precision on high-stakes queries</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Formal verification (math)</td>
<td><strong>Lean 4</strong></td>
<td><code>[EXISTS]</code></td>
<td>Machine-checkable proofs → T2 tier</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Speech / oral history</td>
<td><strong>Whisper</strong> (OpenAI, self-hostable)</td>
<td><code>[EXISTS]</code></td>
<td>Transcribe oral histories, indigenous knowledge</td>
</tr>
